/* ==========================================================================
   Sangreal  —  an Obsidian theme inspired by the Blood Angels
   Day: red chalk, gold leaf and ivory vellum — Renaissance and Baroque.
   Night: oxblood and the Red Thirst.

   Fonts (embedded, SIL Open Font License 1.1):
     EB Garamond        — The EB Garamond Project Authors
     Cormorant Garamond — The Cormorant Project Authors
     IM FELL English SC — Igino Marini (outlines emboldened, embedded as "BA Heading Latin")
     Noto Serif SC      — Adobe (CJK punctuation subset only)
     Manufacturing Consent — The Manufacturing Consent Project Authors (baked into the new-tab inscription image)
   Chinese fonts are not embedded. Headings: 寒蝉活宋体 / ChillHuoSong (ChillType, OFL 1.1); body text:
   思源宋体 / Noto Serif SC (Adobe, OFL 1.1). Each comes from the installed font if present, or from the optional
   snippets in snippets/; otherwise headings fall back to the body font and the body to system 宋体.
   Silhouettes from game-icons.net (CC BY 3.0), modified — by Lorc: bleeding-heart, book-aura, broken-skull,
   candle-light, chalice-drops, curly-wing, feather, holy-grail, hourglass, laurels, quill, ringing-bell,
   scroll-unfurled, sundial, two-feathers, winged-sword; by Delapouite: notebook, tower-flag.
   The question-callout mark is the question mark of Playfair Display Bold (OFL 1.1) with the chapter emblem.
   Wings on the properties frame: traced from a public-domain engraving via Heritage Library (HTC Heritage Type).
   Flourishes and ribbons: modified from frame-illust.com. Failure-callout icon: modified from ICOOON MONO.
   Adeptus Mechanicus emblem and aquila: from the community "wh_icons" set.
   Warhammer 40,000, the Blood Angels and the Adeptus Mechanicus are trademarks of Games Workshop.
   Fan work, not affiliated.

   Built by build.py from src/theme.src.css — edit the source, not theme.css.
   ========================================================================== */
